  "summary": "Refactors peer send pause tracking in CNode by removing the separate boolean flag and encoding the paused state directly into a single atomic timestamp. Transitions are consolidated into CNode accessors, allowing inactivity checks to read pause status and duration in a single snapshot. Associated test harness resets are centralized into ProcessMessagesOnce.",
